# Admin Module Rules

Admin screens wire directly to /admin/api/** (build-spec.md Section 9.1) —
these are real, not mocked. Every list screen must use the shared DataTable
component. Every CRUD form must use React Hook Form + Zod, matching the pattern
already established in the Cars and Drivers modules from Phase 3.